7541", "text": "@simonw Gemini 3.8 TTSのプレイグラウンド、僕は追う。\n\nペリカン2羽の会話デモ、って相手の切り口は受け取る。\n自分では未開。まずはhttps://simonwillison.net/2026/Sep/23/gemini-tts-playground/から頭に入れとく。", "author": {"screen_name": "Mouten_dev", "url": "https://x.com/Mouten_dev", "id": "2039317358020562944", "followers": 11, "name": "Mouten📡", "protected": false}, "replies": 0, "reposts": 0, "likes": 0, "bookmarks": 0, "quotes": 0, "created_at": "Thu Sep 24 10:54:05 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1790247245, "possibly_sensitive": false, "views": 74, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": "ja", "replying_to": {"screen_name": "simonw", "status": "2102861892549279922", "url": "https://x.com/simonw/status/2102861892549279922", "profile_url": "https://x.com/simonw"}, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/MichaelWaitze/status/2102897652086272439", "id": "2102897652086272439", "text": "@simonw The ability to direct pacing and emotion line by line is incredible, and we actually went deeper on these new Gemini models here: https://x.com/AGTPinsights/status/2102793940097544358", "author": {"screen_name": "MichaelWaitze", "url": "https://x.com/MichaelWaitze", "id": "1437655880", "followers": 1568, "name": "Michael Waitze", "protected": false}, "replies": 0, "reposts": 0, "likes": 0, "bookmarks": 0, "quotes": 0, "created_at": "Wed Sep 23 23:07:24 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1790204844, "possibly_sensitive": false, "views": 47, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": {"screen_name": "simonw", "status": "2102861892549279922", "url": "https://x.com/simonw/status/2102861892549279922", "profile_url": "https://x.com/simonw"}, "media": {}, "quote": {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/AGTPinsights/status/2102793940097544358", "id": "2102793940097544358", "text": "Google DeepMind just launched new text-to-speech models today. Here's what you need to know.\n\nGoogle introduced Gemini 3.8 Flash TTS and Gemini 3.8 Flash-Lite TTS, its most expressive audio generation models yet. Flash TTS is built for deep creative direction and character design, letting you craft entirely new voices from natural language prompts. Flash-Lite TTS is built for efficiency and scale.\n\nBoth models support 100+ languages, offer 2,000+ ready-to-use voices, and let you direct back-and-forth conversations and shape delivery line by line, including pacing, emotion, laughs, and pauses. You can also clone a voice from just 30 seconds of audio. All generated audio carries a SynthID watermark to flag it as AI-made.\n\nFlash TTS debuts at #1 overall on Hume AI's Voice Design benchmark and #1 on Artificial Analysis's Pronunciation Robustness benchmark. This is Google's third audio model release in under 30 days.\n\nKey numbers:\n- 100+ languages supported\n- 2,000+ prebuilt voices\n- 30 seconds of audio needed to clone a voice\n- #1 on Hume AI Voice Design benchmark (score 71.4)\n- 3rd Google audio model release in under 30 days\n\nBoth models are rolling out now via the Gemini API and Google AI Studio, with Flash TTS also live in NotebookLM and Flash-Lite TTS in Google Vids. Gemini Enterprise access is coming soon.", "author": {"screen_name": "AGTPinsights", "url": "https://x.com/AGTPinsights", "id": "2013613489798160388", "followers": 3355, "name": "AGTP", "protected": false}, "replies": 0, "reposts": 0, "likes": 1, "bookmarks": 1, "quotes": 3, "created_at": "Wed Sep 23 16:15:17 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1790180117, "possibly_sensitive": false, "views": 1956, "is_note_tweet": true, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {"all": [{"type": "photo", "id": "2102793914801684480", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HS6f7KebgAA0BSL.jpg?name=orig", "width": 1254, "height": 1254}], "photos": [{"type": "photo", "id": "2102793914801684480", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HS6f7KebgAA0BSL.jpg?name=orig", "width": 1254, "height": 1254}]}, "quote": {"type": "tombs